inflatable textile chair falls in the family camping goods, as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 63, confer "This subheading includes camping goods such as inflatable textile chairs, inflatable textile lounge chairs and similar articles".
floorcloth falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Floorcloths, dishcloths, dusters and similar cleaning cloths:".
dishcloth falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Floorcloths, dishcloths, dusters and similar cleaning cloths:".
duster falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Floorcloths, dishcloths, dusters and similar cleaning cloths:".
cleaning cloth falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in ruling NY L88233, confer "The merchandise at issue is a cleaning cloth".
mop cloth falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Dustcloths, mop cloths and polishing cloths".
