shop towel falls in the family cleaning cloth, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Shop towels dedicated for use in garages, filling".
lifejacket falls in the family lifejacket, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Lifejackets and lifebelts".
lifebelt falls in the family lifejacket, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Lifejackets and lifebelts".
