wall banner falls in the family other made up article, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Wall banners, of man-made fibers".
banner falls in the family other made up article, as stated in ruling NY N222082, confer "The applicable subheading for garden banners will be 6307.90.9889".
flag falls in the family other made up article, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "National flags:".
