face mask falls in the family other made up article, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Face masks, including respirators without".
furniture movers pad falls in the family other made up article, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Furniture movers' pads of cotton".
pillow shell falls in the family other made up article, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 63, confer "Pillow shells, of cotton (369)".
