    item 541944 contains 100 percent of polyester.
    the fabric construction of item 541944 is woven.
    item 541944 is made up by production in the finished state.
    the kind of item 542467 is blanket.
    item 542467 contains 100 percent of polyester.
    the fabric construction of item 542467 is knitted.
    item 542467 is made up by hemming.
    % NY E80466: a textile throw of 100 percent polyester knit fleece, edges
    % finished with an overcast stitch -> 6301.40
    the kind of the fleece throw is throw.
    the fleece throw contains 100 percent of polyester.
    the fabric construction of the fleece throw is knitted.
    the fleece throw is made up by sewing.
    % NY N255059: a throw and a tote bag sold together, not a set: each is
    % classified alone. The throw -> 6301.40; the tote bag of polyester ->
    % 4202.92 (Section XI note 1(l))
