    the fabric construction of the gift throw is knitted.
    the gift throw is made up by sewing.
    the kind of the gift tote is tote bag.
    the outer surface of the gift tote is of polyester.
    the gift tote is made up by sewing.
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 377083 is 6301.40", "the subheading of item 541944 is 6301.40", "the subheading of item 542467 is 6301.40", "the subheading of the fleece throw is 6301.40", "the subheading of the gift throw is 6301.40", "the subheading of the gift tote is 4202.92"].

